								"manualContent": "<div style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;color:#111111;\" class=\"rounded p-6 gap-3\"><p>\n\t \n</p>\n\n<p>\n\tThe word ‘Hope’ is defined as a feeling of expectation and desire for certain things to happen, and with our dedicated staff, life-changing outcomes can happen when you enter our Center of Hope.\n</p>\n\n<p>\n\tOur doors are open daily to single adults, families, seniors, and the disabled who have no other option for safe shelter. Keeping with our mission “to meet human needs without discrimination,” we not only offer dormitory-style housing for single guests and apartments for families, but we provide showers and hot meals.\n</p>\n\n<p>\n\t \n</p></div>"
